WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:05.830
In Hamburg, your Mintlify docs open in
English, and the site offers no German.

2
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:11.070
The navigation in docs.json lists one
set of English pages and no languages.

3
00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:14.390
General Translation lets
you choose languages,

4
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:17.710
and Locadex opens a
translation pull request.

5
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:20.910
Authorize the General
Translation app on GitHub,

6
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.830
and choose your docs
repository in the Dashboard.

7
00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:28.140
Create an automation from the Generate
translations and push template for

8
00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:31.510
Mintlify, then run its
setup with your languages.

9
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.840
Locadex's pull request adds a navigation

10
00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:37.910
entry per language and
the translated pages.

11
00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:43.430
The merged site's menu switches the
docs to Spanish, Japanese and German.
